OL,3,AMan jailed for Starmer-linked arson
OL,4,Aattacks is deported
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who plotted to carry out arson
OL,7,Fattacks on property connected to Sir
OL,8,FKeir Starmer has been deported, the
OL,9,FHome Office says.
OL,11,FStanislav Carpiuc, 28, was one of two
OL,12,Fmen convicted over the attacks, which
OL,13,Ftook place in May last year and
OL,14,Ftargeted a car and two houses.
OL,16,FThe Ukrainian-born Romanian national
OL,17,Fwas sentenced to two years in prison in
OL,18,FJune. The Home Office said he had been
OL,19,Fremoved from the UK, without specifying
OL,20,Fwhere he had been sent.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
