OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC revealed the attacks were
OL,7,Fordered on behalf of Russia, with an
OL,8,Fanonymous handler known as EL promising
OL,9,Fpayment to Carpiuc's accomplice, Roman
OL,10,FLavrynovych.
